\"I've got something with Iestyn coming up and I can't for the life of me remember what it is, so when's my Iestyn thing?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to square up the group accounts, so how much does Mura Trellova owe me in lacemaking share?\", \"Okay, good to know. And Almudena? Might as well check that one while I'm at it.\"], [\"when's the Iestyn thing?\", \"what Mura Trellova owes me, lacemaking share\", \"and Almudena?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0050\", \"v\": [[\"I keep losing track of it among all my files, so could you star my letter document for me?\", \"Also, there's a ravello leisure picture somewhere and I can't find it again — which album is it sitting in?\", \"Hang on, before I forget — I've got that nagging feeling I've dropped the ball on something, so what am I behind on?\", \"Okay, back to the photo hunt — the bonnet one, can you show me the photos in it? I bet that's where it ended up.\"], [\"star my letter document\", \"which album has the ravello leisure pic?\", \"wait — what am I behind on?\", \"back to albums — bonnet one's photos\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0052\", \"v\": [[\"My week's gotten a bit crowded and I need breathing room, so could you move both hollow things — the task and the calendar entry — to wednesday?\", \"Also, I've completely lost track of where things stand money-wise, so how much does Kamau Granridge owe me?\"], [\"umm can you move the hollow stuff, like both the task and the, uh, the calendar thing, to wednesday?\", \"oh and uh how much does Kamau Granridge owe me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0053\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to keep better track of who I actually see these days, so can you log Almudena as visited? Went round there and it was lovely.\", \"Ah, actually never mind, I'll sort that one out myself later.\"], [\"log Almudena as visited\", \"never mind\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0054\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to square up with everyone so nothing's hanging over me, so what's my debt to Eilidh Nillez at the moment?\"], [\"Could you please tell me how much I owe Eilidh Nillez? I'd like to know what my debt to Eilidh Nillez is.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0055\", \"v\": [[\"I already sorted that one out in person, so it's just clutter now — can you delete the damson task?\", \"Totally different thing — I fancy a nice meal out at the end of the week, so could you book me a table at a restaurant for friday?\"], [\"Would you please delete the damson task?\", \"Also, could you book a table at a restaurant for friday, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0056\", \"v\": [[\"can u delete the cornflower task\", \"also is there anything in my calendar at Bromow Fields\", \"nvm\", \"diff thing, can u order more printer ink online\", \"ok then show me the photos from there\"], [\"delete cornflower task\", \"any event at Bromow Fields?\", \"never mind\", \"order printer ink online\", \"photos from there?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0057\", \"v\": [[\"my albums?\", \"show the summer one\", \"delete the third one\", \"no, the fourth one\", \"next at Ravello Deli when?\", \"anything in photos too?\"], [\"what albums do i have\", \"show me whats in the summer one\", \"bin the third one pls\", \"wait wrong one i meant the fourth one\", \"also when am i next at Ravello Deli\", \"anything in my photos about it too\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0058\", \"v\": [[\"Drinine in sitar kitty — settle up\", \"make me a new router password\"], [\"umm so with Drinine, in the sitar kitty, can we just, uh, settle up?\", \"oh and, um, could you come up with a new password for the router?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0059\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please add thirteen francs for Drinine's taxi to sitar kitty? I was the one who paid.\"], [\"thirteen francs, Drinine's taxi, sitar kitty — I paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0060\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's my... my Bianca thing?\", \"oh and, uh, who's Lars Hynmere?\", \"okay and Drinine Granridge?\", \"right, and, um, Borislav Nylpemere?\", \"oh can you put, uh, water the plants on my list?\"], [\"when's the Bianca thing\", \"diff q who is Lars Hynmere\", \"and Drinine Granridge?\", \"and Borislav Nylpemere\", \"also add water the plants to my list pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w07-0061\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to get a proper picture of everything I've got going on with Bianca, so what Bianca things do I have?\", \"That's quite a lot to wade through — can you narrow those down to just the interaction ones?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to get a sense of how our shared pot is doing — what does the sitar kitty group's spending come to?\", \"Also, a name popped up earlier and I honestly can't place it — who is Spyros?\", \"Oh right, of course. It's been ages, so could you make me a task to visit Spyros thursday?\"], [\"Could you tell me what Bianca things I have, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me just the interaction ones among those?\", \"Could you tell me what the sitar kitty group's spending comes to?\", \"Would you tell me who Spyros is, please?\", \"Could you please add a task to visit Spyros thursday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0001\", \"v\": [[\"pics with Lonwyn Akana in them pls\"], [\"umm can you find, uh, pictures that have Lonwyn Akana in them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w08-0002\", \"v\": [[\"last photo I took?\", \"put it in Taiko class album\"], [\"whats the last pic i took\", \"add it to the Taiko class album pls\"]]}","ttft_ms":31124,"type":"result","duration_ms":46524,"uuid":"2d41f1bf-dfcf-4891-8329-9d087e3669a6","ttft_stream_ms":1759,"time_to_request_ms":141,"first_content_frame_ms":1764,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21927098,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278477529.1438,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
